@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-03, FR-09, FR-10
' source:       backend/src/routes/video.routes.js, backend/src/services/videoBatch.service.js, backend/src/services/videoProcessing.service.js, STT_Whisper/src/batch_main.py（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-17
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 batch API、Pipeline 交接與 processing state machine 產出循序圖
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 影片建立與知識化處理循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "教師／管理員" as Manager

box "React SPA" #FAFBFB
  participant "TeacherUpload" as UploadPage
  participant "uploadCourseVideos()" as UploadClient
end box

box "Express Backend" #FAFBFB
  participant "VideoBatchController" as BatchController
  participant "VideoBatchService" as BatchService
  participant "CourseAccessService" as AccessService
  participant "VideoService" as VideoService
  participant "VideoProcessingQueue /\nVideoBatchProcessingService" as Scheduler
  participant "VideoController\n(internal webhook)" as VideoController
  participant "VideoProcessingService" as ProcessingService
end box

database "VideoBatch model" as BatchModel
database "Video model" as VideoModel
participant "STT_Whisper Pipeline" as Pipeline
database "video_segments_text" as SegmentStore

Manager -> UploadPage : 選擇 1～10 個影片並送出
UploadPage -> UploadClient : uploadCourseVideos(courseId, items)
UploadClient -> BatchController : POST /courses/{courseId}/video-batches\nmultipart videos + titles
BatchController -> BatchService : createVideoBatch({ courseId, files, titles, user })
BatchService -> AccessService : getCourseByIdOrThrow()\nassertCanManageCourse()
AccessService --> BatchService : 可管理的 Course
BatchService -> BatchModel : create(status=creating, processingMode)

loop 每個上傳項目
  BatchService -> VideoService : createCourseVideo(..., deferProcessingStart)
  VideoService -> VideoModel : 檢查 fileHash 後 create\nprocessing.status = queued
  VideoModel --> VideoService : Video / duplicate error
  alt single_adapter（預設）且可啟動本機處理
    VideoService -> Scheduler : enqueueVideoProcessing(videoId)
    Scheduler -> Pipeline : main.py --video-id ...
  else pipeline_batch
    note over VideoService
      deferProcessingStart=true，交由整批 scheduler 啟動。
    end note
  end
  VideoService --> BatchService : item result
  BatchService -> BatchModel : findOneAndUpdate(items, status=processing)
end

alt VIDEO_BATCH_PIPELINE_ENABLED = true
  BatchService -> Scheduler : scheduleVideoBatchProcessing(batchId, items)
  Scheduler -> Pipeline : batch_main.py --batch-request ...
else false（預設 single_adapter）
  note over BatchService,Scheduler
    各影片已在 createCourseVideo() 內個別排入 queue。
  end note
end

BatchService --> BatchController : durable batch presentation
BatchController --> UploadClient : 201 { batchId, items[] }
UploadClient --> UploadPage : 保留逐檔狀態，可重新載入追蹤

Pipeline -> VideoController : POST /api/v1/internal/videos/{id}/processing/start\nX-Processing-Secret
VideoController -> ProcessingService : startVideoProcessing(videoId)
ProcessingService -> VideoModel : queued -> processing\nattemptCount + 1
Pipeline -> Pipeline : STT、Leaf chunk、embedding\nartifact validation
Pipeline -> SegmentStore : upsert searchable segments

alt 處理成功
  Pipeline -> VideoController : POST .../processing/complete\n{ durationSec, externalVideoId }
  VideoController -> ProcessingService : completeVideoProcessing(videoId, metadata)
  ProcessingService -> VideoModel : processing -> completed
  ProcessingService -> ProcessingService : clear FAQ\nfanout notification\nschedule optional YouTube upload
  ProcessingService --> VideoController : completed Video（可冪等重送）
  VideoController --> Pipeline : 200
else 處理失敗
  Pipeline -> VideoController : POST .../processing/fail\n{ errorCode, errorMessage }
  VideoController -> ProcessingService : failVideoProcessing(videoId, error)
  ProcessingService -> VideoModel : queued/processing -> failed
  ProcessingService --> VideoController : failed Video（保留首次終止失敗）
  VideoController --> Pipeline : 200
end

note over Scheduler,ProcessingService
  UI batch、Backend VideoBatch 與 Python batch CLI 是不同層次。
  processing 非任意寫值，非法狀態轉換回 409。
end note

@enduml
